This repository holds data under two licences and a build script.

<code>/words.tsv
  Adapted from FrequencyWords by Hermit Dave
  https://github.com/hermitdave/FrequencyWords (content/2018, commit 525f9b5)
  Licence: CC BY-SA 4.0, full text in CC-BY-SA-4.0.txt
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/
  Changes: spelling filtered, counts merged, accents normalised, list shortened, scores computed.
  These files carry the same licence.

<code>/bigrams.tsv
  Word pair counts derived from Tatoeba sentences, by Tatoeba and its contributors
  https://tatoeba.org/en/downloads
  Licence: CC BY 2.0 FR
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0/fr/
  Changes: only the commonest next words for each word are kept; no sentence is included.
  The word list above also limits which words appear, so these files are additionally offered
  under CC BY-SA 4.0 for that part.

<code>/letters and index.tsv
  Lists of letters and file hashes, under CC BY-SA 4.0 like the word lists.

tools/build.py
  CC BY-SA 4.0, like the data it builds.

The LibreOffice spelling dictionaries (https://github.com/LibreOffice/dictionaries, commit c0865a8)
were read while building, to decide which words to keep. They are not included.
